    "id": "2064628604773028165", "text": "Claude Fable 5 现已上线http://B.AI \n\nAnthropic 最新发布的 Claude Fable 5 已由http://B.AI 技术团队第一时间完成接入，现已正式开放 API 调用。\n\n作为 Anthropic 迎今最强大的编码模型，Claude Fable 5 专为处理长周期、高不确定性的复杂任务而设计。", "author": {"id": "902839045356744704", "name": "H.E. Justin Sun 👨‍🚀 🌞", "screenName": "justinsuntron", "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1954484454942298112/gmiMeJRS_normal.jpg", "verified": true}, "metrics": {"likes": 32, "retweets": 3, "replies": 31, "quotes": 1, "views": 6891, "bookmarks": 4}, "createdAt": "Wed Jun 10 08:39:52 +0000 2026", "media": [], "urls": ["http://B.AI"], "isRetweet": false, "retweetedBy": null, "lang": "zh", "score": null, "isQuote": true, "isReply": false, "conversationId": "2064628604773028165", "createdAtISO": "2026-06-10T08:39:52+00:00", "createdAtLocal": "2026-06-10 16:39", "quotedTweet": {"id": "2064618291755384941", "text": "📢 Claude Fable 5 现已上线 B.AI\n\nAnthropic 最新发布的 Claude Fable 5 已由 B.AI 技术团队第一时间完成接入，现已正式开放 API 调用。\n\n作为 Anthropic 迎今最强大的编码模型，Claude Fable 5 专为处理长周期、高不确定性的复杂任务而设计。", "author": {"screenName": "BAI_AGI", "name": "B.AI"}}
  },
  {
